  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">ILO Productivity Ecosystems Program</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Productivity Ecosystems Program For Decent Work stems from the SCORE programme, which Norad has funded over several years. ILO has worked with Norad and SECO to develop a new programme, Productivity Ecosystems for Decent Work, which will be implemented in South Africa, Ghana and Vietnam. The Productivity Ecosystems for Decent Work has a multi- layer/multi-institutional approach. This program will include institutions, policy makers private sector and labour organizations in a value-chain based approach</narrative>
  </description>
